        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "„Ich kenne keine größere Belohnung, als mitzuerleben, wie etwas zum Leben erwacht, das man selbst erschaffen hat.“",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "\"I don't know if there's a better reward than seeing something you've built come to life.\"",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "Non credo ci sia miglior ricompensa che vedere qualcosa che hai creato prendere vita.",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "«¿Qué mejor recompensa hay que ver cómo algo que has construido cobra vida?».",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "Existe-t-il meilleure récompense que de voir ses créations prendre vie ?",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        }
      },
      "id": "01JYRGVWHTVTJVPXR153793GYP",
      "text": "\"I don't know if there's a better reward than seeing something you've built come to life.\""
    }
  ],
